CLASS com/xk72/util/class_1535 com/xk72/util/HttpCache
	COMMENT A generic <T, E extends Exception> HTTP response cache with conditional revalidation. Confirmed rather than provisional: the obfuscator left the anonymous inner class HttpCache$1 (this class' backing map) with its outer name intact, and Charles 4's com/xk72/util/r carries this name over ten matching member descriptors.
	COMMENT The backing map is an access-ordered LinkedHashMap built with initialCapacity 400 and load factor 0.75, whose removeEldestEntry caps it at 100 entries -- an LRU. Charles 4 called that inner class CacheMap.
