	METHOD method_4130 maybeRevalidate (Ljava/net/URI;Lcom/xk72/util/class_1547;J)Lcom/xk72/util/class_1547;
		COMMENT Behaviour is certain, the word is not -- Charles 4 left this one unnamed too. Returns the entry unchanged when System.currentTimeMillis() is below its expires; otherwise refetches through the fetcher with the entry's lastModified and etag as the conditional-request parameters, counts a 304 or a miss, and builds a fresh entry whose expires honours Pragma/Cache-Control no-cache, must-revalidate, max-age and Age.
		ARG 1 uri
		ARG 2 cached
		ARG 3 ttlMillis
