		ARG 1 uri
		ARG 2 useCache
		COMMENT When false the cached entry is not passed to revalidation and the result is not stored, so the call both bypasses and does not populate the cache.
		ARG 3 ttlMillis
		COMMENT Passed through to maybeRevalidate, which adds it to the current time to form the new entry's expires.
